                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "location": {
                      "line": 53,
                      "heading": "2.3 Departmental & Donor Scholarships"
                    },
                    "text": "Each department manages additional awards (ranging: $1,000–$6,000/year), often tied to academic major, talent, or declared area of interest.\nVisit scholarships.cendara.edu/departments (https://scholarships.cendara.edu/departments) for details and application instructions."
