              "heading": "Cendara University Financial Aid Guide"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "location": {
                  "line": 110,
                  "heading": "6. Application Procedures"
                },
                "text": "To receive financial aid, applicants must complete the appropriate forms and follow these steps:"
              }
            ],
            "sections": [
              {
